<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cabletel cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cabletel cut to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it cut Cabletel Communications Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Earlier, Cabletel reported fourth quarter earnings per share of C$0.04, flat versus year-ago levels but on 42 percent more shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- U.S. listed shares fell 3/8 to 5-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
